# Wildfire Wickerfolk's delirium counts "cards in YOUR graveyard" (CR 207.2c). Turn 1: Mox Ruby and Mox Jet (which stay on the
# battlefield) and a Mountain pay for Wheel of Fortune: Bot1's graveyard gets the Wheel (sorcery) and three Islands (land) - two card types.
# The same Wheel makes Bot2 discard Ornithopter (artifact creature), Lightning Bolt (instant) and Islands: Bot2's graveyard holds
# artifact, creature, instant and land - four types, which must not count. In turn 3 the Wickerfolk is its printed 3/2 with haste and no trample.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Wheel of Fortune
Island
Island
Island
Wildfire Wickerfolk
Forest
Island x5
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Lightning Bolt
Island x5
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Wheel of Fortune.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Graveyard = Wheel of Fortune; Island; Island; Island
? Bot2.Graveyard.Count = 8
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Wildfire Wickerfolk.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Attack(Wildfire Wickerfolk > Bot2)
[T3 Bot1.DeclareBlockers]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Wildfire Wickerfolk.Power = 3
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Wildfire Wickerfolk.Power = 3
Bot1.Battlefield.Wildfire Wickerfolk.Toughness = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Wildfire Wickerfolk.Keywords = Haste
Bot2.Life = 17
